  - m_ID: 304
    m_Depth: 0
    key: QuoteBaronessChase
    category: 17
    description: IN-GAME (Candy Princess (female))
    translations:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"I won''t sugarcoat it...\nyou never stood a chance!"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"Quelqu''un a eu les yeux plus gros\nque le ventre."'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"Inutile addolcir la pillola...\nLa sconfitta è sempre amara!"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"Ich sag''s mal unverblümt ...\ndu hattest nie eine Chance!"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"No os lo voy a endulzar...\n¡Os he mandado a pastar!".'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"No te lo voy a endulzar...\n¡Te he mandado a pastar!"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"난 꾸미고 싶은 생각 따위 없어...\n가능성은 0퍼센트야!"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: «Думаешь меня победить?\nА не слипнется?»
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"Na osłodę powiem tylko,\nże nie mieliście żadnych szans!"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"Mamãe passou açúcar em mim,\nentão tira a mão!"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 甘い言葉なんてかけないわよ…\nあなたには見込みがないもの！
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"我就不挑好听的说了......你根本毫无胜算！"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    translationsCuphead: []
    translationsMugman: []
    enabled: 0
