  - m_ID: 357
    m_Depth: 0
    key: Angel_W1_S1_PreMauso_Line1_B
    category: 27
    description: IN-GAME
    translations:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Begone, spirits! Oh, wait... you're real.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Allez:vous:en, esprits_! Oh, pardon... Vous êtes bien réels.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Fuggi, spirito! Oh ma... sei reale.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Verschwindet, Geister! Oh, Moment ... ihr seid echt.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: ¦Fuera de aquí, espíritus! Ay, espera... ¦Que sois reales!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: ¦Fuera de aquí, espíritus! Oh, esperen... son reales.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 귀신아, 썩 물러가라! 앗, 잠시만... 아니잖아.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Дух, изыди! Э, постой:ка, ты что, живой?
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Precz, siło nieczysta! O, chwila... nie jesteście duchami.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Vade retro, fantasma! Ah, não... vocês são reais.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: きゃ！オバケ！\nあら…なんだ\n生きてるカップじゃない。
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 滚开，鬼魂！哦，等等......\n你们是真实存在的。
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    translationsCuphead: []
    translationsMugman: []
    enabled: 0
  - m_ID: 358
    m_Depth: 0
    key: Angel_W1_S1_PreMauso_Line2_B
    category: 27
    description: IN-GAME
    translations:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: I was about to hit you with the ol' parry move!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Un peu plus et je vous envoyais une bonne vieille parade_!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Stavo per colpirti con la mia classica parata!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Wollte euch gerade mit der Parade angreifen!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: ¦Estaba a punto de golpearos con un movimiento de parada!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: ¦Estaba a punto de golpearlos con el viejo movimiento de desvío!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 까딱했으면 회피 공격으로 널 때렸을지도 몰라!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: А я тебя чуть было не пре:парировала!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Właśnie miałam was odbić!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Eu já ia aparar essa louça de vocês!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: アンタたちを「パリィ」で\nひっぱたくところだったわ。
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 我差点使出经典的格挡招式对付你们！
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    translationsCuphead: []
    translationsMugman: []
    enabled: 0
  - m_ID: 359
    m_Depth: 0
    key: Angel_W1_S1_PreMauso_Line3_B
    category: 27
    description: IN-GAME
    translations:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: That's how you deal with ghosts 'round here.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: C'est comme ça qu'on se débarrasse des fantômes, ici.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: È così che trattiamo gli spettri da queste parti.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: So wird man nämlich mit den Geistern hier fertig.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Así es como se acaba con los fantasmas, ¿sabéis?
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Así es como lidiamos con los fantasmas por aquí.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 이 주변을 떠도는 유령들은 그런 식으로 다뤄야 해.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: С духами только так и получается справиться.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Tak tu się rozprawiamy z duchami.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: É assim que a gente cuida de fantasmas.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: この辺じゃそうやって\nオバケをやっつけるの。
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 对付这一带的鬼魂就得用那招。
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    translationsCuphead: []
    translationsMugman: []
    enabled: 0
  - m_ID: 360
    m_Depth: 0
    key: Angel_W1_S1_PreMauso_Line4_B
    category: 27
    description: IN-GAME
    translations:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Only a nitwit tries shootin' someone who ain't really there.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Il faut être bête pour tirer sur quelqu'un qui n'est pas vraiment présent.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Solo un fessacchiotto sparerebbe a qualcosa che non c'è.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Nur Hohlköpfe schießen auf Sachen, die gar nicht da sind.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Solo un idiota le dispararía a algo que no está aquí.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Solo un idiota intenta dispararle a alguien que no está ahí.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 바보가 아니고서야 허깨비한테 총을 쏴대진 않겠지.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Стрелять по ним бессмысленно, тела:то нет.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Tylko dureń strzelałby do kogoś, kogo tam nie ma.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Só um trouxa tenta atirar em algo que não está lá.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 実体のない連中をショットで\n倒そうとするのは\nおマヌケさんだけよ。
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 只有傻子才会朝没有实体的东西射击。
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    translationsCuphead: []
    translationsMugman: []
    enabled: 0
  - m_ID: 361
    m_Depth: 0
    key: Angel_W1_S1_PreMauso_Line5_B
    category: 27
    description: IN-GAME
    translations:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Speakin' of not bein' places... would you fellas mind movin' on?
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: En parlant de présence... vous pouvez déguerpir_?
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: A proposito di non esserci... Ti faresti un giro?
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Wo wir gerade bei fehl am Platz sind ... würdet ihr bitte verschwinden?
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Y hablando de no estar aquí... ¿Os importaría largaros, muchachos?
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Hablando de no estar ahí... ¿les importaría largarse a otro lado?
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 말이 나와서 말인데... 다른 데로 좀 가줄 순 없어?
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Но хоть ты и не дух, изыди все равно!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: A skoro mowa o niebyciu... nie zechcielibyście stąd wybyć?
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Falando em não estar em algum lugar... dá pra vocês tomarem seu rumo?
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 「いない」といえば…\nあなた、そろそろいなくなって\nもらえない？
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 说了这么多......\n你们两个家伙能别杵在这儿吗？
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    translationsCuphead: []
    translationsMugman: []
    enabled: 0
  - m_ID: 362
    m_Depth: 0
    key: Angel_W1_S1_PreMauso_Line6_B
    category: 27
    description: IN-GAME
    translations:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: You're spookin' the fish.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Vous faites peur aux poissons.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Spaventi i pesci.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Ihr verschreckt die Fische.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Me estáis espantando a los peces.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Me están espantando a los peces.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 너희 때문에 물고기가 겁먹고 있잖아.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Ходят тут всякие, рыбу пугают...
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Płoszycie ryby.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Tão assustando os peixes.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: お魚が怯えて逃げちゃうじゃない。
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 你们把鱼都吓跑了。
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    translationsCuphead: []
    translationsMugman: []
    enabled: 0
