  - m_ID: 406
    m_Depth: 0
    key: TutorialExShotInstructions
    category: 32
    description: IN-GAME
    translations:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: AN UPGRADED ATTACK THAT\nREQUIRES ONE SUPER METER CARD.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: UNE ATTAQUE PLUS PUISSANTE\nQUI NÉCESSITE UNE CARTE AU COMPTEUR DE SUPER.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: UN ATTACCO POTENZIATO CHE RICHIEDE UNA CARTA SULLA SUPER-BARRA.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: EIN SPEZIALANGRIFF, DER EINE\nSUPERMETER-KARTE ERFORDERT.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: UN ATAQUE MEJORADO PARA EL QUE NECESITAS UNA CARTA EN EL INDICADOR DE SÚPER.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: UN ATAQUE MEJORADO QUE\nREQUIERE UNA CARTA EN EL INDICADOR DE SÚPER.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 필살기를 쓸 수 있어요.\n슈퍼 미터 카드 한 장이 필요해요.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 32
        tmpFontType: 14
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: УСИЛЕННАЯ АТАКА, РАСХОДУЕТ ОДНУ КАРТУ СПЕЦАТАКИ.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: WZMOCNIONY ATAK WYMAGAJĄCY\nJEDNEJ KARTY NA SUPERPASKU.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: UM ATAQUE APRIMORADO QUE \nEXIGE UMA CARTA DE SUPERMEDIDOR.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 必殺技ゲージを使う。\n強力な攻撃だ！
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 一次强力攻击，需要消耗\n一张必杀计量条卡。
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    translationsCuphead: []
    translationsMugman: []
    enabled: 0
