  - m_ID: 427
    m_Depth: 0
    key: Quartet_W2_S1_MemberLost_Line1_B
    category: 27
    description: IN-GAME
    translations:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Whoever heard of a barbershop trio?
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Un quatuor de trois membres, ça n'existe pas_!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Non s'è mai visto un quartetto con tre membri!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Wer hat je von einem Barbershoptrio gehört?
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: ¿Dónde se ha oído hablar de un trío de peluquería?
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: ¿Quién ha oído hablar del trío de la barbería?
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 혹시 '고음불가'가 뭔지 아는 사람?
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: От нашего квартета осталось только трое!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Słyszał ktoś o trio z zakładu fryzjerskiego?
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Não dá pra respeitar um TRIO de barbeiros!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: ３人しかいないアカペラ４人組なんて、\n意味わかんないよ！
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 有谁听说过理发店三重唱吗？
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    translationsCuphead: []
    translationsMugman: []
    enabled: 0
  - m_ID: 428
    m_Depth: 0
    key: Quartet_W2_S1_MemberLost_Line2_B
    category: 27
    description: IN-GAME
    translations:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: If we can't find our fourth member, we'll never sound right again!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Si on ne retrouve pas notre quatrième, ce ne sera plus harmonieux_!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Se non troviamo il quarto, addio al nostro canto melodioso!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Wenn wir unser viertes Mitglied nicht finden, klingen wir nie wieder gut!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Si no encontramos al cuarto miembro, ¦nuestro nombre no sonará bien nunca!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Si no encontramos al cuarto miembro, ¦no volveremos a cantar bien nunca!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 네 번째 멤버를 구하지 못하면 우리도 딱 그짝이 날 거라고!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Без четвертого мы играть не можем, только соображать на троих получается.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Jeśli nie znajdziemy czwartego do kwartetu, nigdy nie zagramy jak trzeba!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Se não acharmos o quarto membro, nunca mais vamos cantar direito!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: ４人目を見つけ出せなきゃ\nきれいな合唱なんて二度とできやしない…
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 如果我们找不到第四位成员，\n就没法组成像样的合唱团了！
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    translationsCuphead: []
    translationsMugman: []
    enabled: 0
  - m_ID: 429
    m_Depth: 0
    key: Quartet_W2_S1_MemberLost_Line3_B
    category: 27
    description: IN-GAME
    translations:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Be a pal and let us know if you spot him, won't you?
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Soyez gentils, prévenez:nous si vous l'apercevez, d'accord_?
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Siate gentili e fateci sapere se lo incontrate!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Seid so lieb und gebt uns Bescheid, wenn ihr ihn seht, okay?
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Sed buenos y avisadnos si lo encontráis, ¿vale?
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Sean buenos y avísennos si lo ven, ¿sí?
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 협조 좀 해주겠어? 괜찮은 인재를 찾거든 좀 알려달라구.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Дай знать, если найдешь его где:нибудь!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Bądźcie tak mili i dajcie nam znać, jeśli go zauważycie, dobra?
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Se vocês virem ele por aí, avisa pra gente, na amizade?
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 彼を見かけたら\nボクらに知らせてくれないかい？
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 如果你们发现了他，就告诉我们，\n好吗？
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    translationsCuphead: []
    translationsMugman: []
    enabled: 0
  - m_ID: 430
    m_Depth: 0
    key: LostBarber_W2_S1_MemberLost_Line1_B
    category: 27
    description: IN-GAME
    translations:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: At last! I thought I'd never see another living soul again!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Enfin_! J'ai bien cru ne jamais revoir un être vivant_!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Finalmente! Disperavo di rivedere anima viva!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Endlich! Ich dachte schon, ich würde nie wieder jemand Lebendiges sehen!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: ¦Por fin! ¦Creía que no volvería a ver a otro ser vivo!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: ¦Por fin! ¦Creí que no volvería a ver a otro ser vivo!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 맙소사, 살아 있는 생명체가 더 있을 줄 상상도 못 했는데!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Ура, я уж думал, так и помру тут в одиночестве!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Nareszcie! Już myślałem, że nigdy nie ujrzę żywej duszy!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Até que enfim! Achei que nunca mais ia ver vivalma!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 助かった！もう二度と\nタマシイをもった生き物には\n会えないかと思ったよ！
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 我还以为再也见不到别的活人了呢！\n终于给我见到了！
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    translationsCuphead: []
    translationsMugman: []
    enabled: 0
  - m_ID: 431
    m_Depth: 0
    key: LostBarber_W2_S1_MemberLost_Line2_B
    category: 27
    description: IN-GAME
    translations:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: I lost my way while searching for coins.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Je cherchais des pièces et j'ai perdu mon chemin.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Ho smarrito la via cercando monete.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Ich habe mich auf der Münzsuche verlaufen.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Me perdí mientras buscaba monedas.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Me perdí mientras buscaba monedas.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 코인을 찾느라 길을 잃어버리고 말았지.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Я тут монеты искал и, похоже, слегка увлекся.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Zgubiłem się, szukając monet.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Eu me perdi procurando moedas.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: コインを探しているうちに\n道に迷っちゃったんだ。
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 我在找硬币的时候迷路了。
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    translationsCuphead: []
    translationsMugman: []
    enabled: 0
  - m_ID: 432
    m_Depth: 0
    key: LostBarber_W2_S1_MemberLost_Line3_B
    category: 27
    description: IN-GAME
    translations:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: No one has money for haircuts these days, thanks to that blasted casino!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: De nos jours, personne n'a les moyens de se faire couper les cheveux à cause de ce satané casino_!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Di questi tempi, chi può vivere di sola musica? Colpa di quell'infame casinò!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Dank des verdammten Kasinos hat heutzutage hat keiner mehr Geld für den Friseur!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: ¦Por culpa de ese maldito casino, ya nadie tiene dinero para cortarse el pelo!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: ¦Por culpa de ese maldito casino, ya nadie tiene dinero para cortarse el pelo!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 요즘은 다들 주머니 사정이 아주 쓸쓸하지. 그 얼어 죽을 노름터 때문에 말야!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 'За стрижку-то никто не платит: денег ни у кого нет, а как появятся, они их в казино просаживают.'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Przez to przeklęte kasyno już nikt nie ma pieniędzy na fryzjera!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Graças àquele cassino, esse povo não tem mais dinheiro nem pra cortar o cabelo!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: この頃はあの忌々しいカジノの\nせいでみんなヘアカットする\nお金もないんだ！
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 这年头，人们理发的钱都掏不出来了，\n都怪那座该死的赌场！
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    translationsCuphead: []
    translationsMugman: []
    enabled: 0
  - m_ID: 433
    m_Depth: 0
    key: LostBarber_W2_S1_MemberLost_Line4_B
    category: 27
    description: IN-GAME
    translations:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Well, I'd better get back to my pals in the quartet!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Bon, je ferais mieux d'aller retrouver mes camarades du quatuor_!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Beh, meglio che torni al mio quartetto!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Ich sollte lieber wieder zurück zu meinen Kumpels aus dem Quartett!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: En fin, ¦será mejor que vuelva con mis compañeros del cuarteto!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: En fin, ¦será mejor que vuelva con mis compañeros de cuarteto!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 음, 아무래도 사중창단 동료들한테 돌아가야겠어!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Ладно, пойду-ка я к ребятам, соскучился без них!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Dobra, to ja wracam do moich kumpli z kwartetu!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Bom, melhor eu voltar pra junto do quarteto!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: さて、ボクも仲間のところに戻った方がいいね。
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 呃，我最好回四重奏乐团找我的\n伙计们去！
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    translationsCuphead: []
    translationsMugman: []
    enabled: 0
  - m_ID: 434
    m_Depth: 0
    key: Quartet_W2_S2_MemberFound_Line1_B
    category: 27
    description: IN-GAME
    translations:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Oh boy, you did it! We're a quartet once more!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Ça par exemple, vous avez réussi_! Le quatuor est réuni_!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Oh bella, ci siete riusciti! Rieccoci un quartetto!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Wow, ihr habt es geschafft! Wir sind wieder ein Quartett!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: ¦Anda! ¦Lo habéis conseguido! ¦Ya volvemos a ser un cuarteto!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: ¦Oh, vaya, lo lograron! ¦Volvimos a ser un cuarteto!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 우왓, 너희들이 해냈구나! 이제 다시 사중창단으로 돌아갈 수 있어!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Вау! Спасибо! Теперь нас снова четверо!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Rany, udało wam się! Znowu jesteśmy kwartetem!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Não acredito! Somos um quarteto de novo!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: やった！\nこれでボクら４人組の復活だ！
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 哎呀呀，你们成功了！\n四重唱组合的成员再次齐聚一堂！
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    translationsCuphead: []
    translationsMugman: []
    enabled: 0
  - m_ID: 435
    m_Depth: 0
    key: Quartet_W2_S2_MemberFound_Line2_B
    category: 27
    description: IN-GAME
    translations:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Gee, you must have run yourself ragged tracking him down!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Vous avez dû vous épuiser à retrouver sa trace_!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Urca, avrete sudato sette camicie per ritrovarlo!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Mann, ihr müsst euch bei der Suche ja die Hacken wund gelaufen haben!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: ¦Caray, supongo que estaréis agotados de tanto buscarlo!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: ¦Caray, debieron haberse cansado hasta los huesos por buscarlo!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 맙소사, 그 녀석을 쫓느라 몰골이 말이 아니군!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Небось найти нашего друга было непросто.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Ja cię, musieliście się nieźle namęczyć, żeby go znaleźć!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Rapaz, achar ele não deve ter sido fácil!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: ああ、彼を探すために\nクタクタにさせてしまったようだね！
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 你们找他肯定找得很辛苦吧！
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    translationsCuphead: []
    translationsMugman: []
    enabled: 0
  - m_ID: 436
    m_Depth: 0
    key: Quartet_W2_S2_MemberFound_Line3_B
    category: 27
    description: IN-GAME
    translations:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: We can't thank you enough! Let's celebrate with a song!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Merci mille fois_! Fêtons ça en chanson_!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Come potremo mai ringraziarvi? Lo so, festeggeremo con una melodia!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Wir können euch gar nicht genug danken! Lasst uns das mit einem Lied feiern!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: ¦Mi agradecimiento no tiene parangón! ¦Vamos a celebrarlo con una canción!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: ¦Mi agradecimiento tiene ubicación! ¦Vamos a celebrarlo con una canción!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 어찌나 고마운지 말도 안 나오네! 자, 노래로 이 마음을 보여주자!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Спасибо! Мы тут сочинили песню про твой подвиг!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Nie wiem, jak wam dziękować! Zaśpiewajmy z tej okazji piosenkę!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Nem temos como agradecer! Vamos comemorar com uma canção!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 感謝してもしきれないよ！\n歌でお祝いをしよう！
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 真不知怎么谢你们才好！\n我们就演奏一曲以示庆祝吧！
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    translationsCuphead: []
    translationsMugman: []
    enabled: 0
  - m_ID: 437
    m_Depth: 0
    key: Quartet_W2_S2_MemberFound_Line4_B
    category: 27
    description: IN-GAME
    translations:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Ready, boys? Key of B flat...
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Prêts, les gars_? En si bémol...
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Pronti? Chiave di si bemolle...
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Bereit, Jungs? Los, in B:Dur ...
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: ¿Listos, muchachos? En si menor...
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: ¿Listos, muchachos? En si menor...
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 준비됐지, 친구들? 장조는 내림 나야...
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Так. парни. Ми мажор, на раз:два:три...
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Gotowi, panowie? Gramy w B...
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Prontos, rapazes? Si maior...
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: みんな、いいかな？シのフラットの音で…
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 伙计们，准备好了吗？\n降B调......
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    translationsCuphead: []
    translationsMugman: []
    enabled: 0
  - m_ID: 438
    m_Depth: 0
    key: Quartet_W2_S3_SongRepeat_Line1_B
    category: 27
    description: IN-GAME
    translations:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Can't get enough of that diddy, eh?
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Vous en voulez encore, c'est ça_?
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: È un motivetto che non tedia mai, dico bene?
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Ihr bekommt davon gar nicht genug, was?
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Uno nunca se cansa de esa cantinela, ¿verdad?
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Uno nunca se cansa de esa cantaleta, ¿verdad?
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 아까 그걸로는 부족했나 봐?
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Да хорош резину тянуть!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Tego grajka nigdy dość, co?
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Ah, gostou da cantoria, né?
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: これっぽっちじゃ満足できないんだね？
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 听一遍还不过瘾么？
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    translationsCuphead: []
    translationsMugman: []
    enabled: 0
  - m_ID: 439
    m_Depth: 0
    key: Quartet_W2_S3_SongRepeat_Line2_B
    category: 27
    description: IN-GAME
    translations:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Okay, boys, one more time! With feeling!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Allez, les gars. Encore une fois_! Mettez:y du cœur_!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Ancora una volta, ragazzi! Con sentimento!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Okay, Jungs, noch mal! Mit Gefühl!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: ¦Muy bien, chicos, otra vez! ¦Esta vez, dándolo todo!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: ¦Muy bien, chicos, otra vez! ¦Pero esta vez, dándolo todo!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 좋아, 한 번 더 가자고! 감정을 팍 실어서!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Давайте, парни, еще раз, с чувством!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Dobra, panowie, jeszcze raz! Tym razem z sercem!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Tudo bem, rapazes, mais uma vez! Com sentimento!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: OK、みんなもう一回だ！気持ちを込めて！
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 好吧，伙计们，再来一次！\n这一次要带情感！
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    translationsCuphead: []
    translationsMugman: []
    enabled: 0
