  - m_ID: 486
    m_Depth: 0
    key: Professional_W3_S1_LessThan5As_Line2_B
    category: 27
    description: IN-GAME
    translations:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: There is a class of Grade A people, and then there is... well...
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Il y a les gens de rang_A, et puis... il y a...
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Esistono le persone con "voto A" e poi esistono, beh...
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Es gibt echte Topleute und dann gibt es ... tja ...
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Están las personas de nivel A y, luego, está..., bueno...
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Existen personas de nivel A, y luego existen... bueno...
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 이 세상은 말이지, A급 사람들과... 뭐랄까...
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Есть те, кто достиг рейтинга А, и есть... ну...
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Są prymusi oraz... reszta...
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Tem o povo que é Nota A, e aí tem... bom...
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 世の中にはAランクの方々と\nそれから、その…
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 有一个班级里全是优等生，\n其他班级里......
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    translationsCuphead: []
    translationsMugman: []
    enabled: 0
