  - m_ID: 602
    m_Depth: 0
    key: Juggler_W2_S2_HitParryLimit_Line1_B
    category: 27
    description: IN-GAME
    translations:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Hey, I heard you managed to parry four times in a row!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Hé, il paraît que vous avez réussi quatre parades à la suite_!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Ehi, ho sentito che avete parato quattro volte di fila!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Hey, wie ich höre, habt ihr viermal hintereinander pariert!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Eh, ¦dicen que habéis conseguido realizar cuatro paradas seguidas!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: ¦Oigan, escuché que lograron desviar cuatro veces seguidas!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 이봐, 연속으로 4번 피하는 데 성공했다면서?
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Я слышал, тебе удалось отбить четыре удара подряд.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Ej, słyszałem, że udało się wam odbić cztery razy z rzędu!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: E aí! Ouvi dizer que vocês conseguiram aparar quatro ataques em seguida!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: ねえキミ！４回連続パリィを\n成功させたんだってね！
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 喂，听说你们已经成功地\n连续格挡了四次！
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    translationsCuphead: []
    translationsMugman: []
    enabled: 0
  - m_ID: 603
    m_Depth: 0
    key: Juggler_W2_S2_HitParryLimit_Line2_B
    category: 27
    description: IN-GAME
    translations:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: I'll bet you're so proud you could bust!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Vous devez être fiers comme des matamores_!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Traboccate d'orgoglio, scommetto!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Ihr müsst vor Stolz platzen!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: ¦Apuesto a que estáis tan henchidos de orgullo que podríais explotar!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: ¦Apuesto a que están tan orgullosos que podrían reventar!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 스스로 꽤 자랑스러울 거야. 그렇지?
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Такое упорство достойно поощрения!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Założę się, że pękacie z dumy!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Aposto que estão explodindo de orgulho!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: きっとキミ自身も\n誇らしいだろうなあ！
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 你们自豪得都要碎了吧！
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    translationsCuphead: []
    translationsMugman: []
    enabled: 0
  - m_ID: 604
    m_Depth: 0
    key: Juggler_W2_S2_HitParryLimit_Line3_B
    category: 27
    description: IN-GAME
    translations:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Here's a coin to reward your persistence, boys!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Prenez cette pièce, je vous félicite pour votre persévérance_!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Ecco una moneta per la vostra perseveranza!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Hier habt ihr eine Münze als Belohnung für eure Hartnäckigkeit, Jungs!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: ¦Aquí tenéis una moneda para recompensar vuestra tenacidad, chicos!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: ¦Aquí tienen una moneda como recompensa por su persistencia, muchachos!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 너희들의 열성에 감복했어. 보답으로 코인을 줄게!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Вот, держи монетку!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Macie tu monetę w nagrodę za starania, chłopcy!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Aqui, peguem uma moeda pela persistência, rapazes!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: キミたちのガッツを称えて、\nこのコインをおくるよ！
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 为了奖励你们锲而不舍的精神，\n这枚硬币给你们！
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    translationsCuphead: []
    translationsMugman: []
    enabled: 0
  - m_ID: 605
    m_Depth: 0
    key: Juggler_W2_S2_HitParryLimit_Line4_B
    category: 27
    description: IN-GAME
    translations:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Don't spend it all in one place, now!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Mais ne dépensez pas tout d'un coup_!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Non spendetela subito, datemi retta!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Gebt nicht alles auf einmal aus!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: ¦No la gastéis toda de golpe!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: ¦Pero no la gasten toda de una sola vez!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 낭비하지는 말고!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Но не трать все сразу!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Tylko nie przehulajcie jej od razu!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Não gastem tudo de uma vez, viu?
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 無駄遣いしちゃだめだよ！
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 别把它一下子用掉！
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    translationsCuphead: []
    translationsMugman: []
    enabled: 0
  - m_ID: 606
    m_Depth: 0
    key: Juggler_W2_S3_GotJugglerCoin_Line1_B
    category: 27
    description: IN-GAME (After this line, player is rewarded a coin)
    translations:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: You fellas really inspired me!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Vous êtes une source d'inspiration pour moi_!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Mi siete stati d'ispirazione!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Ihr habt mich wirklich motiviert!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Chicos, ¦sois una inspiración!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
