  - m_ID: 750
    m_Depth: 0
    key: Professional_Tooltip_SuperEquip
    category: 31
    description: IN-GAME (This is a secret, if the player gets it - they receive a new VISUAL FILTER (Fork-man, male))
    translations:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: My dear friends, you just earned a great bonus. Check out yer option menu for a new visual mode!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 1
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Mes amis, vous avez gagné un bonus. Un nouveau mode visuel est disponible dans les options_!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 1
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Miei cari amici, avete appena ottenuto un grande bonus. Nel menu opzioni troverete una nuova modalità video!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 1
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Meine lieben Freunde, ihr habt gerade einen tollen Bonus erhalten. Im Optionsmenü erwartet euch ein neuer Ansichtsmodus!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 1
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Mis queridos amigos, habéis obtenido una fantástica bonificación. ¦Id al menú Opciones para acceder a un nuevo modo visual!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 1
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Mis queridos amigos, obtuvieron una fantástica bonificación. ¦Vayan al menú Opciones para acceder a un nuevo modo visual!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 1
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 친구들, 방금 엄청난 보너스를 받았네. 옵션 메뉴를 열어서 새로운 그래픽 모드를 즐겨봐!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 9
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Ты заслужил награду! Открой меню параметров и опробуй новый цветовой режим.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 1
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Kochani, zdobyliście coś niesamowitego. Zajrzyjcie do menu opcji! Jest tam nowy filtr grafiki!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 1
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Meus caros amigos, vocês acabam de ganhar um belo bônus. Entrem no menu de opções para ver o novo modo visual!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 1
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: やあ、親愛なるキミたち。\nステキなボーナスを獲得したよ。\nオプションメニューで\n新しいビジュアルモードを\nチェックしてごらん！
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 15
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 24
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 亲爱的朋友们，你们刚赢得了一份不得了的奖励。去选项菜单找找新的画面模式吧！
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 13
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    translationsCuphead: []
    translationsMugman: []
    enabled: 0
  - m_ID: 751
    m_Depth: 0
    key: Canteen_Tooltip_ShmupWeapons
    category: 31
    description: IN-GAME (; is a different character in the English font used so translate with the correct symbol for the language)
    translations:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Your aeroplanes are now equipped with mini;bombs. Switch your weapon anytime during battle!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 1
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Vos avions sont maintenant équipés de mini:bombes_! Changez d'arme à tout moment en combat_!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 1
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Ora i vostri aerei sono dotati di mini bombe! Potete cambiare arma in qualsiasi momento durante la battaglia!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 1
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Eure Flugzeuge sind jetzt mit Minibomben bestückt! Ihr könnt die Waffe im Kampf jederzeit wechseln!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 1
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: ¦Ahora vuestros aviones están equipados con minibombas! ¦Cambiad de arma en cualquier momento del combate!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 1
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: ¦Ahora sus aviones están equipados con minibombas! ¦Cambien de arma en cualquier momento del combate!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 1
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 비행기에 소형 폭탄이 장착되었어! 전투 중 언제든지 무기를 바꿀 수 있어!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 9
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Теперь твой аэроплан оснащен мини:бомбами. Переключиться на них можно в любой момент боя.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 1
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Teraz wasze samolociki są uzbrojone w bomby! Możecie zmieniać broń w dowolnym momencie walki!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 1
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Seus aviões agora tem minibombas!! Para usá:las, é só trocar de arma durante a batalha!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 1
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 飛行機にミニボムが装備されたぞ！\nバトル中、いつでも武器の切り替えができるぞ！
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 15
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 24
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 你们的飞机现在装备上了迷你炸弹！！在战斗中可随时切换武器！
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 13
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    translationsCuphead: []
    translationsMugman: []
    enabled: 0
  - m_ID: 752
    m_Depth: 0
    key: KingDice_Tooltip_RegularSoulContracts
    category: 31
    description: IN-GAME (King Dice (male) is reiterating that the player needs to battle the bosses in REGULAR mode to get a soul contract. https://drive.google.com/file/d/1022NIF5EphjeB8QkztDFcWxYtJ_AI1oZ/view?usp=sharing)
    translations:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Remember. Only a regular battle will let you collect a debtor's soul contract... now scram.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 1
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Attention_! Seuls les combats normaux permettent d'obtenir des pactes d'âmes... Allez, filez_!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 1
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Ricorda! Solo una battaglia normale ti darà il contratto dell'anima di un debitore. Chiaro?
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 1
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Nicht vergessen. Seelenverträge könnt ihr nur in regulären Kämpfen gewinnen ... und jetzt ab mit euch!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 1
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Recordad que solo podréis conseguir el contrato de alma de un deudor en una batalla en Normal... ¦Venga, fuera de aquí!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 1
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: ¦Recuerden! Solo podrán conseguir el contrato de alma de un deudor en una batalla normal... ¦Andando, fuera de aquí!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 1
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 명심해! 영혼 계약서는 일반 전투에서만 얻을 수 있어. 자, 그럼 열심히 해보라고!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 9
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Запомни! Только бой в обычном режиме позволит тебе заполучить договор. А теперь брысь!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 1
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Pamiętajcie! Tylko w trybie zwykłym można zdobyć cyrograf dłużnika... no już was tu nie ma!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 1
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Ó, pres'tenção! Só uma batalha normal te permite coletar o contrato de alma de um devedor. ...agora, xô!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 1
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 覚えておきたまえ。レギュラー\nモードのバトルでのみ債務者の\n「タマシイの契約書」を獲得できる\n…さあ行け！
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 15
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 24
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 记住！只有在普通模式的战斗中你才能收集欠债者的灵魂契约...现在快滚吧！
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 13
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    translationsCuphead: []
    translationsMugman: []
    enabled: 0
