  - m_ID: 1697
    m_Depth: 0
    key: Boatman_Tooltip_UpgradedSave
    category: 31
    description: 'This is going to be a "Tooltip" that appears for players who are returning to Cuphead after owning the main game and having newly purchased DLC. It is from the perspective of the Boatman character, asking you to come see him. '
    translations:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: The Legendary Chalice has an urgent message for you. Find me on the coast, cups.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 1
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Le Calice légendaire a un message urgent pour vous. Retrouvez:moi sur la côte.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 1
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Calice delle Meraviglie ha un messaggio urgente per voi. Mi troverete sulla costa, tazzine.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 1
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Der Legendäre Kelch hat eine dringende Nachricht für euch. Tassen, kommt zu mir an die Küste.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 1
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: El Cáliz Legendario tiene un mensaje urgente para vosotros. Os estoy esperando en la costa, tacitas.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 1
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: El Cáliz Legendario tiene un mensaje urgente para ustedes. Les estoy esperando en la costa, tacitas.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 1
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 전설의 성배가 급히 전할 말이 있다는구나. 해변으로 찾아오거라, 컵들아.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 9
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: У меня для вас срочное послание от Древней Чаши, черепки. Найдите меня на берегу.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 1
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Bajeczna Czarka ma dla was pilną wiadomość. Spotkajmy się na brzegu, filutki.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 1
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: A Cálice Lendária tem uma mensagem urgente para vocês. Falem comigo na costa, xícaras.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 1
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 伝説の聖霊チャリス様から、\n急ぎの伝言があるんだ。\n海岸で俺のことを見つけてくれ。
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 15
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 24
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 小杯子，记得来海岸找我，传说中的圣杯有个急信托我捎给你们。
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 13
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    translationsCuphead: []
    translationsMugman: []
    enabled: 0
