  - m_ID: 1727
    m_Depth: 0
    key: NewsieCat_WDLC/S1_Line1
    category: 27
    description: This character is a small cat who is a "Newsie" (old timey newspaper boy). When you first meet him, he will be reading out the headline of a paper he is selling, and "Extry!! Extry!!" is a variant spelling of the phrase "Extra!! Extra!!" which was used to North America to get the attention of passersby and sell papers on the streets. Please feel free to use a culturally relevant variant if it exists. The headline is straightforward, and should borrow from your official translation of the name "Chef Saltbaker"
    translations:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Extry! Extry! Chef Saltbaker Awarded Best Baker In All The Lands!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Extra_! Extra_! Le chef Lasalière reçoit le titre de meilleur boulanger de toutes les contrées_!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Ultime notizie! Pinzimonio Salieri premiato miglior pasticcere del mondo!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Extrablatt! Extrablatt! Konditormeister Salzbäcker als bester Konditor ausgezeichnet!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: ¦Extri! ¦Extri! ¦El Chef Saleroso recibe el premio a mejor panadero del mundo mundial!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: ¦Extri! ¦Extri! ¦El Chef Saleroso recibe el premio a mejor panadero del mundo mundial!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 호외요! 호외! 솔트베이커 주방장이 세계 최고의 제빵사로 뽑혔습니다!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Сенсация! Сенсация! Шеф:повар Солонкин стал лучшим кондитером в мире!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Dodatek! Dodatek! Solisław Tejziemski najlepszym piekarzem na świecie!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Extra! Extra! Chef Pitadinha é considerado o Melhor Padeiro do Mundo!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 号外！号外！\nシェフ・ソルトベイカー、最優秀パティシエの\n栄冠に輝く！だニャ！
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 号外！号外！盐大厨荣获\n诸岛最佳面包师奖！
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    translationsCuphead: []
    translationsMugman: []
    enabled: 0
  - m_ID: 1728
    m_Depth: 0
    key: NewsieCat_WDLC/S1_Line2
    category: 27
    description: 'The Newsie Cat character has a UK British tone of voice, so we have used "Oi!" which is UK slang used to get someone''s attention. Feel free to use culturally relevant equivalent, or maintain British tone in translation.  Note: There are 3 possible ways the Newsie can speak to the player, depending on what % of the game they have beaten prior to arriving at the DLC Island. This line is used for players who have beaten the least %, and refers to them as "marks" (a gullible figure easily tricked). And "''ere" is shorthand for "here"'
    translations:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 'Oi! You marks from around ''ere? '
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Salut, les gringalets. Vous êtes du coin_?
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Oh! Voialtri siete di queste parti?
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Ui! Seid ihr Schlauberger von hier?
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: ¦Yep! ¿Sois de por aquí, primos?
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: ¦Ei! ¿Son de por aquí, primos?
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 이봐, 거기 어리숙한 놈들! 너희 이곳 출신이야?
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Эй! Парни, вы не местные?
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Siema! Wy stąd, pacany?
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Aew! Cês são daqui, trutas?
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: ニャニャニャ！\n君、この辺の子じゃないニャ。
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 诶唷！你们两个身上有点货呀？\n是外头来的还是岛上的呀？
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    translationsCuphead: []
    translationsMugman: []
    enabled: 0
  - m_ID: 1729
    m_Depth: 0
    key: NewsieCat_WDLC/S1_Line3
    category: 27
    description: 'This is a followup line for players who have not beaten a lot of the game. This is just a made up 30s phrase we created, referring to "tough nuts" (hard bosses), and implying that the player has "noodle arms" (is weak) and won''t be able to "wrench it" (handle it). There is a link between nuts and wrench for a metaphor. Feel free to create your own similar sentiment! '
    translations:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 'This isle''s full of tough nuts, ''n your noodle arms ain''t gonna wrench it. '
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Y a de sacrés costauds sur cette île. Avec vos bras en guimauve, vous risquez pas de leur faire peur_!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Quest'isola è piena di ossi duri, con quelle braccine a fettuccina non ve la caverete.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Auf dieser Insel gibt's eine Menge harter Jungs, da kriegt ihr mit euren Spaghettiarmen Probleme.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Las islas están llenas de gente con mu mala baba, y con esos fideos que tenéis por brazos, malamente podréis con ellos.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Las islas están llenas de gente con mu mala vibra, y con esos fideos que tienen por brazos, difícilmente podrán con ellos.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 이 섬에는 강한 녀석들이 득실대. 너희 같은 약골은 상대도 안 될걸!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: На этом острове полно крепких орешков. Они не по вашим фарфоровым зубам!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Tu na wyspie jest pełno twardzieli, takie leszcze jak wy mogą nie dać rady.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Essa quebrada aqui é treta, e dois frango que nem vocês só vão levar PT aqui.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: この島の連中はガチガチの\n石頭ばっかりだニャ、\nそんなフニャフニャの腕じゃ\n奴らをかち割れそうにないニャ。
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 这岛上的可都是硬茬，\n你们俩细胳膊细腿的，能受得了吗？
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    translationsCuphead: []
    translationsMugman: []
    enabled: 0
