  - m_ID: 2107
    m_Depth: 0
    key: dlc_intro_cinematic_0018
    category: 26
    description: 'Spoken by Chef Saltbaker, while holding up recipe page for a Wondertart. Note: as indicated in ID 1724, Wondertart can be translated at linguist''s discretion to refer to their own made up confection name representing something magical, or literally!'
    translations:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"One bite of this Wondertart, and you:ll have complete control over the astral plane!"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"Une seule bouchée de mon Abracadacquoise vous donnera un contrôle total sur le plan astral_!"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"Un solo morso di questo Fantastruffolo e avrete il completo controllo del piano astrale!"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"Nur ein Bissen von dieser Wundertorte und ihr habt die vollständige Kontrolle über die Astralebene!"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"Un mordisquito de esta fantastitarta ¡y tendréis control total y absoluto del plano astral!".'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"Un mordisquito de esta fantastitarta ¡y tendrán control total y absoluto del plano astral!".'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"이 원더타르트를 한 입만 먹으면 영혼 세계를 마음껏 다룰 수 있단다!"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: «Всего кусочек чудо-торта, и силы астрала покорятся вам!»
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"Wystarczy kęs tej bajkotarty, żeby uzyskać pełną kontrolę nad wymiarem astralnym!"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"Basta uma mordida da minha Tortuprema, e vocês terão controle completo do plano astral!"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 「このワンダー・タルトはたった一口で、\n幽界を思いのままに支配することが出来るのです！」
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: “只要吃上一口这个神奇馅饼，\n你就能完全控制星界啦！”
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    translationsCuphead: []
    translationsMugman: []
    enabled: 0
  - m_ID: 2108
    m_Depth: 0
    key: dlc_intro_cinematic_0019
    category: 26
    description: Spoken by Cuphead, in response to hearing news about Wondertart
    translations:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"This Wondertart could bring Chalice back to life for good? No swapping places or nothin:?"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"Votre Abracadacquoise pourrait ramener Calice à la vie, sans qu:un de nous prenne sa place_?"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"Questo Fantastruffolo la riporterà in vita una volta per tutte? Senza doverci scambiar di posto o cose simili?"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"Kann diese Wundertorte Fräulein Kelch für immer ins Leben zurückbringen? Ganz ohne Platztausch?"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"¿Esta fantastitarta podría devolver a Cáliz a la vida de verdad? ¿Sin intercambiar posiciones ni nada así?".'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"¿Esta fantastitarta podría devolver a Cáliz a la vida de verdad? ¿Sin intercambiar posiciones ni nada así?".'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"원더타르트는 챌리스를 완전히 살려낼 수 있는 건가요? 누구랑 자리만 바꾸거나 하는 게 아니라?"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: «Этот чудо-торт сможет вернуть нам Чашу? Просто так, без этих вот «кто-то должен занять ее место?»»
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"Bajkotarta może przywrócić Czarkę do życia na stałe? Bez zamiany miejsc i tak dalej?"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"Essa Tortuprema conseguiria trazer a Cálice de volta à vida de vez? Sem trocar de lugar com ninguém?"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 「ワンダー・タルトならチャリスを生き返ったままに出来るのか？\n入れ替わりはナシで？」
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: “这个神奇馅饼不会跟之前的饼干一样吧？\n它能让圣杯小姐永远留在阳界吗？”
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    translationsCuphead: []
    translationsMugman: []
    enabled: 0
  - m_ID: 2109
    m_Depth: 0
    key: dlc_intro_cinematic_0020
    category: 26
    description: Spoken by Chef Saltbaker
    translations:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"Indeed! Just one problem... the recipe requires exceptional ingredients held by the most fearsome of foes!"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"Exact_! Il n:y a qu:un souci. La recette requiert des ingrédients rares, détenus par de vils ennemis_!"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"Certo! C:è solo un problemuccio... La ricetta richiede ingredienti eccezionali, custoditi dai più temibili nemici!"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"So ist es! Aber ... das Rezept erfordert Zutaten, die im Besitz der schrecklichsten Gegner sind!"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"¡En efecto! Pero hay un problemilla... ¡Necesitamos ingredientes únicos que están en poder de temibles enemigos!".'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"¡Así es! Pero hay un problemilla... ¡Necesitamos ingredientes únicos que están en poder de temibles enemigos!".'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"그래! 다만 한 가지 문제가 있어... 이 레시피에 필요한 고급 재료들은 무시무시한 적들이 가지고 있거든!"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: «Именно! Но есть небольшая проблемка... Ингредиенты для торта хранятся у очень, очень грозных противников!»
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"Tak! Ale jest szkopuł. Na składnikach trzymają łapę straszliwi wrogowie!"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"Exato! Só tem um problema... A receita exige ingredientes excepcionais, que estão sob posse de adversários extremamente temíveis!"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 「いかにも！ただひとつ問題がありまして…このレシピに\n必要な材料を持っているのは、最恐最悪の悪党たちなのです。」
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: “没错！不过眼下有个问题……配方里要用到的材料都挺难找，\n想要找齐，就得去会一会岛上最可怕的几个敌人！”
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    translationsCuphead: []
    translationsMugman: []
    enabled: 0
  - m_ID: 2110
    m_Depth: 0
    key: dlc_intro_cinematic_0021
    category: 26
    description: Spoken by Cuphead
    translations:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"Well, if the Wondertart is what it takes to bring Chalice back to life, then by golly, we:ll find those ingredients!"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"Pas grave_! Si c:est la seule façon de ramener Calice à la vie, on va les trouver, vos ingrédients_!"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"Beh, se il Fantastruffolo servirà a riportare Chalice alla vita, allora perdincibacco, troveremo quegli ingredienti!"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"Wenn die Wundertorte Fräulein Kelch ins Leben zurückbringt, werden wir diese Zutaten besorgen!"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"¡Anda, la osa! Si con esta fantastitarta Cáliz vuelve a la vida, ¡no quedará otra que encontrar esos ingredientes!".'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"¡Anda, la osa! Si con esta fantastitarta Cáliz vuelve a la vida, ¡no quedará otra que encontrar esos ingredientes!".'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"원더타르트로 챌리스를 살려낼 수 있다면 당연히 재료를 찾아야죠!"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: «Если Чашу можно вернуть только с помощью чудо-торта - делать нечего, мы найдем все нужные ингредиенты!»
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"No, ale jeśli ta bajkotarta przywróci życie Czarce, to nie ma to tamto! Zdobędziemy jej składniki!"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"Bom, se essa Tortuprema é o que a Cálice precisa pra voltar à vida, a gente vai tirar leite de pedra pra pegar esses ingredientes!"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 「チャリスが生き返るためにワンダー・タルトが必要だって言うなら、\nオレたちがその材料を持ってきてやるよ！」
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: “好，要是神奇馅饼真能让圣杯小姐起死回生，\n那找齐材料的事就交给我们吧！”
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    translationsCuphead: []
    translationsMugman: []
    enabled: 0
