  - m_ID: 2147
    m_Depth: 0
    key: QuoteSnowCultPhaseTwo
    category: 17
    description: 'In this 2nd phase of the fight, the cult leader transforms himself into a large snow beast, and if you lose, you see this phrase from the beast. We tried to give the beast a similar tone of voice to The Hulk.  "Iced" is a play on the idea of someone being killed or defeated, using the word Ice. '
    translations:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"ICED ALREADY? WHERE\nPUNY CUPS GO?"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"Mes ennemis, je les refroidis_!"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"DOVE SIETE, TAZZINE GRACILI? GIÀ SOTTO GHIACCIO?"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"SCHON VEREIST? WO SEIN KLEINE TASSEN?"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"DIOSES Y TAZAS A MÍ...".'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"DIOSES Y TAZAS A MÍ...".'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"벌써 얼어붙었나? 약골 컵 같으니!"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: «ЧТО, ЗАЛЕДЕНЕЛИ, ЧЕРЕПКИ?»
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"NO I CO, GLINIANY BRACHU? CO TAK DZWONI CI ZE STRACHU?"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"JÁ GELARAM? ONDE XÍCRAS FRACAS FORAM?"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 「カップアイスはキンキンに冷え切ったかの？\nそれとも溶けて消えたかの？」
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: “已经给冻成渣了？\n我那两个可爱的小茶杯去哪儿了？”
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    translationsCuphead: []
    translationsMugman: []
    enabled: 0
  - m_ID: 2148
    m_Depth: 0
    key: QuoteSnowCultPhaseThree
    category: 17
    description: 'In this 3rd phase of the fight, the snow beast transforms into a large snow flake with the face of the cult leader, and players fight the boss above the cult dome against a background of the Northern Lights. This is another idiosyncratic English pun with the boss saying "It''s all over for you", but using part of the word Aurora Borealis (Northern Lights). "Aurora Bore-all" '
    translations:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"It''s Aurora Borea-all over for you!"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"Alors, on est en froid, vous et moi_?"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"Preparatevi ad andare all''inverno, pupazzi!"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"Jetzt ist Aurora Borealis aus!"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"¡Con la Aurora Boreal, os daré vuestra muerte más especial!".'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"¡Con la Aurora Boreal, les daré su muerte más especial!".'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"오로라여, 이리 오로라!"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: «Ты узнаешь, что напрасно называют север крайним!»
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"Pada śnieg i świecą zorze... Nic i nikt wam nie pomoże".'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"A Aurora Boreal brilhará sobre seus corpos congelados!"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 「見よ、このオーロラの天幕を！\nおぬしらもこれで幕引きじゃな！」
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: “好极了！你们两个要死光光了！”
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    translationsCuphead: []
    translationsMugman: []
    enabled: 0
  - m_ID: 2149
    m_Depth: 0
    key: QuoteRumRunnersPhaseOne
    category: 17
    description: 'This fight is against The Moonshine Mob, a group of bug mafia members who are implied to be managing an underground rum running operation. The first phase is against a spider who is one of the lead mobsters, and while the fight is going on, cops who look like ants pop in and out of the scene chasing you both. This win quote is meant to symbolize that the spider has defeated both you and the cops, with "eatin'' dirt" representing the player being dead, and "bingo bingo" being a made up phrase meant to evoke the tone/dialect of Italian-American mafia. '
    translations:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"One-two punch, you and da cops are eatin'' dirt. Bingo bingo!"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"C''est qu''on a un sacré punch, nous autres, pas vrai_?"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"Pim pum pà, tanti saluti a te e ai quaquaraquà!"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"Eins, zwei, weg, jetzt fresst ihr Dreck! Bingo, bingo!"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"Si a mi famiglia venís a incordiare, tanto la pasma como voi me las vais a pagare".'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"Si a mi famiglia venís a incordiare, la polizia y voi me las van a pagare".'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"한 대, 두 대! 짭새들이랑 같이 바닥에 눕혀주마!"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: «Бззз-бзз - уноси готовенького! Бзз-бзз - коп на новенького!»
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"Raz, dwa, trzy i kap-kap-kap... Dzyń, dzyń, brzdęk i klap-klap-klap!"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"Ma che, já morreram? Nem precisamos avisar o capo que tivemos problemas."'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 「ワン・ツー・パンチで大当たり！\nアリのポリ公どもとクサい飯を食らいな！」
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: “一下两下连着打，你跟警察都得入土啦！\n嘿嘿，喂喂！”
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    translationsCuphead: []
    translationsMugman: []
    enabled: 0
  - m_ID: 2150
    m_Depth: 0
    key: QuoteRumRunnersPhaseTwo
    category: 17
    description: 'This 2nd phase of the fight is against the Spider Mobster''s wife, who is a lounge singing light bug. She sings and dances during this phase, so her quote indicates that "this dance is over" (as in, you have lost), and "giggle juice" here is an old timey saying for alcohol. The idea being that "you couldn''t handle your booze," or you were a lightweight/pushover to battle against. '
    translations:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"This dance is over, there''s no excuse... you couldn''t handle the giggle juice."'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"La chanson est terminée, aucune excuse pour ceux qui ont un coup dans le nez_!"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"La danza è finita, non hai scusanti... Dovresti sederti al tavolo dei poppanti!"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"Der Tanz ist aus und auch euer Dusel ... Ihr wart ohne Chance gegen den Fusel."'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"El baile ha terminado, ya lo creo... Y no soportasteis mi dulce contoneo".'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"El baile ha terminado, ya lo creo... Y no soportaron mi dulce contoneo".'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"무대의 막이 내렸군... 주량이 약한 모양이야."'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: «От танца со мною тебе не спастись, а ты напился так, что ноги заплелись!»
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"Koniec zabawy, żadnych wymówek... Dzban zawsze kończy tak jak półgłówek!"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"Nostra bebida é potente, xicrinhas... Vocês non aguentam dançar conosco."'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 「ダンスはすんだ…しなをつくるのもなし…\nイスですでに泥酔だものね。」
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: “舞也快结束了，你俩也快到头了……\n小小的杯子装不了什么货，输了就是输了。”
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    translationsCuphead: []
    translationsMugman: []
    enabled: 0
  - m_ID: 2151
    m_Depth: 0
    key: QuoteRumRunnersPhaseThree
    category: 17
    description: 'This 3rd phase of the fight is against a large ant eater character who emerges from the background. And he is saying that you are going to be "pushin'' up roses" (another expression for dead). The rhyme here is between "nose is" and "roses", and he is calling himself "dis nose" (as in "this nose", referencing his facae) '
    translations:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"One thing dis nose knows is, youse cups gonna be pushin'' up roses!"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"Tous les chemins mènent au rhum_!"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"Ero certo del tuo trapasso. Per queste cose ho davvero buon nasso!"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"Eines weiß sie, diese Nase, ihr zwei Tassen seid bald im Grabe!"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"No quishiera yo meter lash narishesh, pero eshtash tashitash shon fiambresh".'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"No quishiera yo meter lash narishesh, pero eshtash tashitash shon fiambresh".'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"개미핥기라고 개미한테만 위험한 게 아니야!"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: «Клянусь своим носом, ваша жизнь под вопросом!»
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"Jak się ma nosa, to dobrze wie się... Kto cwaniakuje, ten kończy w lesie!"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"Este mio nariz non deixa dúvida: essas xícaras se borraram todas!"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 「バラバラのカップにはバラの花が\nお似合いだぜ。鼻向けに飾ってやるよ。」
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: “我这直觉准得很，你们见阎王就是这个时辰！”
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    translationsCuphead: []
    translationsMugman: []
    enabled: 0
  - m_ID: 2152
    m_Depth: 0
    key: QuoteRumRunnersPhaseFour
    category: 17
    description: There is a unique 4th phase of this boss fight, where the players feel they ahve defeated the anteater, only to have the REAL mob boss (a small snail with slicked back hair) emerge from his hat. He is indicating that he surprised you, and that you shouldn't forget about him (the boss of the whole operation)
    translations:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"Surprise! Forgetting about da\nboss ain''t wise."'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"Surprise_! Ne bougez pas, je vais vous refiler une sacrée gueule de bois_!"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"Sorpresa sorpresa! Congedarsi senza il boss sarebbe un''offesa!"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"Überraschung unterm Hut! Jetzt braucht ihr noch mal mächtig Mut!"'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"¡Sorpresa! No es bueno menospreciar a vuestra presa".'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"¡Sorpresa! No es bueno menospreciar a su presa".'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"까꿍! 보스를 잊으면 안 되지."'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: «Сюрприз! Забыли про босса, валитесь носом вниз!»
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"Niespodzianka! Chyba nie spodziewaliście się baranka".'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: '"Sorpresa! Capo que é capo só aparece no final."'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 「じゃっじゃーん！主役は遅れてやって来る！」
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: “诶嘿，吓一跳吧！忘了真正的首领可就\n太蠢了吧！”
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
