  - m_ID: 2158
    m_Depth: 0
    key: QuoteKingOfGamesBishop
    category: 17
    description: 'This is a win quote for a 1-phase fight against a bishop character, mentioning he has you beat from "every angle", alluding to the diagonal movement of a bishop on a chess board. '
