    key: QuoteKingOfGamesRook
    category: 17
    description: 'This is a win quote for a 1-phase fight against a Rook chess piece character, and he is saying it was "straighforward" (easy) to beat you, while also referencing the straight line direction the rook moves in on a chess board. '
    translations:
