  - m_ID: 2221
    m_Depth: 0
    key: Saltbaker_Tooltip_SimpleIngredient
    category: 31
    description: 'This is a tool tip description provided by Chef Saltbaker, used to remind the player that they must defeat the game on "Regular" difficulty level to earn an ingredient for their fight '
    translations:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Remember, friends! Only besting a baddie on regular difficulty will earn you an ingredient for the Wondertart. Hop to it!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 1
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: N'oubliez pas, les amis_! Il faut battre les méchants en difficulté normale pour obtenir les ingrédients de l'Abracadacquoise. Allez, au boulot_!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 1
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Ricordate, amici! Dovete sconfiggere i cattivoni a difficoltà normale per ricevere gli ingredienti del Fantastruffolo. Bando agli indugi!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 1
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Denkt dran, Freunde! Nur wenn ihr einen Gegner in der Schwierigkeit "Normal" bezwingt, gibt es eine Zutat für die Wundertorte. Nichts wie los!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 1
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: ¡Amigos, recordad que solo conseguiréis ingredientes para la fantastitarta si derrotáis a los malosos en dificultad Normal! ¡Venga, al lío!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 1
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: ¡Amigos, recuerden que solo conseguirán ingredientes para la fantastitarta si derrotan a los malosos en dificultad Normal! ¡Andado!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 1
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 명심해라! 보통 난이도에서 악당을 물리쳐야 원더타르트의 재료를 얻을 수 있어. 서두르렴!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 9
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: И помните, друзья, получить ингредиенты для чудо:торта можно, только победив злодея на обычном уровне сложности. Приступим!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 1
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Pamiętajcie, składniki bajkotarty można zdobyć tylko po pokonaniu jednego z największych łobuzów na zwykłym poziomie trudności. Do dzieła!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 1
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Lembrem:se, amigos! Vocês precisam vencer um inimigo na dificuldade normal para obter o ingrediente da Tortuprema. Força no... hã... O que vocês tem na cabeça, mesmo? É leite?
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 1
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 覚えておいてくださいね。レギュラ\nーモードでワルモノを倒した時だけ\nワンダー・タルトの材料が\n手に入る…さあ行って！
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 15
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 24
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 朋友，别忘了，你得先在普通难度下击败一个坏蛋，才能得到神奇馅饼的材料。好了，开干吧！
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 13
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    translationsCuphead: []
    translationsMugman: []
    enabled: 0
  - m_ID: 2222
    m_Depth: 0
    key: Chalice_Tooltip_GotAllIngredients
    category: 31
    description: 'This is a tool tip description provided by Ms. Chalice, used when the player has obtained all ingredients for the Wondertart, and is being directed to go back to Saltbaker. "Lickety-split" is an old timey expression for "quickly" '
    translations:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: We did it! That was the last ingredient we needed for the Wondertart. Let's get back to Saltbaker, lickety:split!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 1
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Nous avons réussi_! C'était le dernier ingrédient requis pour l'Abracadacquoise. Retournons voir le chef Lasalière sans perdre un instant_!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 1
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Ce l'abbiamo fatta! Questo era l'ultimo ingrediente per il Fantastruffolo. Torniamo da Salieri, a tutta birra!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 1
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Wir haben es geschafft! Das war die letzte Zutat für die Wundertorte. Jetzt nichts wie zurück zu Salzbäcker!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 1
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: ¡Lo hemos conseguido! Ese era el último ingrediente que necesitábamos para la fantastitarta. ¡Volvamos raudos junto a Saleroso!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 1
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: ¡Lo logramos! Ese era el último ingrediente que necesitábamos para la fantastitarta. ¡Volvamos rápido con Saleroso!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 1
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 해냈다! 원더타르트의 재료를 전부 모았어. 그러면 어서 솔트베이커에게 돌아가자!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 9
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: У нас получилось! Мы добыли последний ингредиент для чудо:торта. Скорее бежим обратно к Солонкину!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 1
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Udało się! To już ostatni składnik potrzebny do zrobienia bajkotarty. Wracajmy do Solisława, migusiem!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 1
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Conseguimos! Esse era o ingrediente que faltava para a Tortuprema. Vamos voltar para o Pitadinha. Sebo nas canelas!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 1
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: やった！ワンダー・タルトに必要な\n材料が全部手に入ったわ。ソルト\nベイカーのところに戻りましょう！
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 15
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 24
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 成了！这就是神奇馅饼配方里最后一样材料了！快回去找盐大厨吧，麻利点！
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 13
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    translationsCuphead: []
    translationsMugman: []
    enabled: 0
  - m_ID: 2223
    m_Depth: 0
    key: NPCClimbingContest/FirstEncounter
    category: 27
    description: 'Please refer to separate document provided by Studio MDHR for explanation of this line '
    translations:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: An audience, at last! The climbing contest medal ceremony is about to begin!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Enfin, du public_! La cérémonie de remise des médailles de la compétition d'escalade va bientôt commencer_!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Finalmente degli spettatori. Possiamo dare inizio alla cerimonia di premiazione!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Endlich haben wir Publikum! Gleich geht die Siegerehrung für den Kletterwettbewerb los!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: ¦Por fin tenemos público! ¦Está a punto de empezar la ceremonia de entrega de medallas del concurso de escalada!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: ¦Por fin tenemos público! ¦Está a punto de empezar la ceremonia de entrega de medallas del concurso de escalada!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 드디어 관중이 왔군! 등반 대회의 메달 수여식이 곧 시작할 거야!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Зрители, наконец:то! Церемония награждения победителей конкурса скалолазания вот:вот начнется!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Nareszcie widownia! Uroczystość wręczenia medali w konkursie wspinaczkowym zaraz się zacznie!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Enfim, uma plateia! A cerimônia de medalhas da competição de escalada já vai começar!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: ついに観客が来た！\nこれでようやく山登りコンテストの\nメダル授与式が始められる！
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 观众总算来了！\n好，登山比赛的颁奖仪式马上开始！
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    translationsCuphead: []
    translationsMugman: []
    enabled: 0
  - m_ID: 2224
    m_Depth: 0
    key: ChaliceFan_Tooltip_NewFilter
    category: 31
    description: 'This is a tool tip description from the "Chalice Super Fan" Cactus NPC, which players will obtain to describe their reward after beating all bosses with Ms. CHalice '
    translations:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: For wallopin' every boss with Ms. Chalice, I've made her a spiffy new look. Find it in the Options menu!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 1
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Pour féliciter Mme_Calice d'avoir vaincu tous les boss, je lui ai créé un nouveau look absolument épatant. Il se trouve dans le menu des options_!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 1
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Ora che Chalice ha sbaragliato i boss, si meritava un bel completino. Lo troverai nel menu delle opzioni!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 1
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Dafür, dass Fräulein Kelch jeden Boss verkloppt hat, habe ich einen schicken neuen Look für sie. Ihr findet ihn in den Optionen!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 1
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Como premio por vencer a todos los jefes con la señorita Cáliz, le he preparado un elegante atuendo nuevo. ¡Está disponible en el menú de Opciones!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 1
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Como premio por vencer a todos los jefes con la señorita Cáliz, le preparé un elegante atuendo nuevo. ¡Está disponible en el menú de Opciones!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 1
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 미스 챌리스로 보스를 혼내줄 때마다 그녀에게 줄 새 의상을 만들었어. 옵션 메뉴에서 확인해 봐!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 9
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Чтобы Золотая Чаша побеждала не только уверенно, но и стильно, я подобрала ей новый образ. Ищите его в меню параметров.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 1
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Za sprostanie wszystkim bossom jako Czarka otrzymujesz nową skórkę dla niej. Znajdziesz ją w menu opcji!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 1
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Por ter vencido todos os chefões com a Srta. Cálice, fiz um visual novo e supimpa pra ela. Para usá:lo, acesse o menu de opções!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 1
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: ボスを全員やっつけたご褒美に、\nチャリスに“素敵な姿”を\nプレゼント。オプションメニュー\nからどうぞ！
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 15
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 24
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 你们跟圣杯小姐一起打败了所有\n首领，恭喜啊！我给她弄了个\n新造型，可好看了，在设置菜单里就能找到！
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 13
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    translationsCuphead: []
    translationsMugman: []
    enabled: 0
  - m_ID: 2225
    m_Depth: 0
    key: Quadratus_W2_S4_DjimmiHint
    category: 27
    description: 'This is a new line for the character "Quadratus", an illusion in a pool that always uses rhyming speech. It can be translated with other rhyming cadence if you choose, but the mention of "spin in place" must be maintained, as we have changed this code''s activation conditions from a button press to the character spinning around in circles. PLEASE RETRANSLATE. '
    translations:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: I sense a need for help in thee...{BR}just spin in place and count to three!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Vous qui semblez aux abois...{BR}Tournoyez sur place et comptez jusqu'à trois.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Avverto un bisogno di aiuto in te...{BR}Ruota sul posto e conta fino a tre!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Ihr braucht wohl Hilfe, eieiei ...{BR}Dreht euch im Kreise und zählt bis drei.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Percibo en ti un gran estrés...{BR}¦Gira en el sitio y cuenta hasta tres!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Percibo en ti un gran estrés...{BR}¦Gira en el sitio y cuenta hasta tres!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 도움이 필요한 모양이군...{BR}제자리에서 빙빙 돌면서 셋까지 세면 될 거야!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 'Помочь тебе : вот мой каприз...{BR}Сочти до трех и покружись!'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Czuję, że ktoś czegoś potrzebuje...{BR}Zakręć się w miejscu i policz do trzech!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Sinto que devo ajudar vocês...{BR}Basta dar piruetas contando ate três.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 助くる為、汝に託す...{BR}命のコードは、LUXを3度。
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 我感尔等遇艰难……{BR}只需原地转三圈。
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    translationsCuphead: []
    translationsMugman: []
    enabled: 0
  - m_ID: 2226
    m_Depth: 0
    key: GameDjimmi_Tooltip_Wish1
    category: 31
    description: 'This is a tool tip that comes up after players input the above prompt detailing that they have unlocked access to a new "Cheat" feature that will double their HP until they next win a battle. '
    translations:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: It is I, Game Djimmi! I grant thee 3 wishes and this is the first.\nEach wish doubles HP 'til the next win.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: C'est moi, Djinn, le génie des jeux_! J'accorde trois souhaits, et ceci est le premier. Chaque souhait double les PV jusqu'à la prochaine victoire.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Sono io, Gigio Pro-gamer! Esaudirò tre desideri e questo è il primo. Ciascun desiderio raddoppierà gli HP fino alla prossima vittoria.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Ich bin es, Spiel-Djimmi! Ich gewähre euch drei Wünsche, und dies ist der erste. Jeder Wunsch verdoppelt eure TP bis zum nächsten Sieg.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: ¡Soy yo, Game Genio! Os otorgaré tres deseos, siendo este el primero. Cada uno de los deseos duplica vuestros PS hasta la siguiente victoria.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: ¡Soy yo, Game Genio! Les concederé tres deseos, siendo este el primero. Cada uno de los deseos duplica sus PS hasta la siguiente victoria.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 나는 게임 지니다! 네 소원을 세 개 들어주도록 하지. 소원을 한 번 빌면 다음으로 승리할 때까지 HP를 두 배로 늘려주마.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 'Я Джимм этой игры! У меня есть для тебя три желания, и вот первое из них: с каждым желанием и до следующей победы твои ОЗ удваиваются!'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Oto ja, Dżinn Gry! Spełniam pierwsze z twoich trzech życzeń. Każde z nich podwoi twoje PZ do kolejnego zwycięstwa.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Sou eu, Genésio, o Gamer! Eu lhe concedo 3 desejos, e este é o primeiro. Cada um duplica seus PV até a próxima vitória.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 助けを求むる声の聞こゆる...{BR}その場で回り、3つ数えろ。
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 是我，游戏基弥！我答应给你3个\n愿望，这就是你第1个愿望：生命值翻倍。不过等你赢了，这个效果就没了！
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    translationsCuphead: []
    translationsMugman: []
    enabled: 0
  - m_ID: 2227
    m_Depth: 0
    key: GameDjimmi_Tooltip_Wish2
    category: 31
    description: 'Second tool tip prompt relating to the above '
    translations:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: I grant your second wish of double HP 'til your next victory!\nOnly one more wish left, so use it wisely!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: J'exauce votre deuxième souhait doublant les PV jusqu'à votre prochaine victoire_! Il ne vous en restera plus qu'un seul après cela, alors faites-en bon usage_!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 'Secondo desiderio esaudito: HP raddoppiati fino alla prossima vittoria! Ti resta un solo desiderio, perciò usalo con saggezza!'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Ich gewähre euch den zweiten Wunsch doppelter TP bis zu eurem nächsten Sieg! Ihr habt nur noch einen Wunsch übrig, also nutzt ihn weise!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 'Os concederé el segundo deseo: ¡hasta la próxima victoria, los PS serán el doble! Ya solo os queda un deseo, ¡usadlo de forma responsable!'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 'Les concederé el segundo deseo: ¡hasta la próxima victoria, los PS serán el doble! Ya solo les queda un deseo, ¡úsenlo de forma responsable!'
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 두 번째 소원이다. 다음으로 승리할 때까지 HP를 두 배로 늘려주마! 소원은 한 번밖에 남지 않았으니 신중하게 사용하거라!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Я исполню твое второе желание - удвоить ОЗ до следующей победы! Осталось всего одно желание, используй его с умом!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Spełniam drugie twoje życzenie i podwajam PZ do kolejnego zwycięstwa! Zostało ci tylko jedno, więc zachowaj je na ważną okazję!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Concedo seu segundo desejo de PV dobrado até sua próxima vitória! Só resta mais um desejo, então use-o com sabedoria!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 2つ目の願いは、次に勝つまで\nＨＰをまた2倍にすること！残された\n願いはあとひとつ、賢く使いたまえ！
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 这是第2个愿望，生命值翻倍。等你赢了，这个效果就没了！好了，还剩最后一个愿望了，许之前可得好好想清楚啊！
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    translationsCuphead: []
    translationsMugman: []
    enabled: 0
  - m_ID: 2228
    m_Depth: 0
    key: GameDjimmi_Tooltip_Wish3
    category: 31
    description: 'Third toolt ip prompt relating to the above '
    translations:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: You have called and the Game Djimmi has answered!\nYour final wish is granted!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Djinn le génie des jeux répond toujours à l'appel_! Votre dernier souhait est exaucé_!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Il gamer chiama e Gigio risponde! Il tuo ultimo desiderio è stato esaudito!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Ihr habt gerufen und Spiel-Djimmi hat geantwortet! Euer letzter Wunsch sei hiermit gewährt!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: ¡Habéis llamado y Game Genio ha cumplido! ¡Vuestro último deseo ha sido concedido!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: ¡Me llamaron y Game Genio cumplió! ¡Su último deseo ha sido concedido!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 게임 지니가 부름에 응했노라! 마지막 소원을 들어 주마!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Ты загадал, а Джимм игры исполнил! Последнее желание потрачено!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Wzywasz mnie – i oto jestem! Ja, Dżinn Gry! Trzecie i ostatnie życzenie spełnione!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Você chamou e Genésio, o Gamer, responde! Seu último desejo foi concedido!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: ゲーム魔神ジーミが、最後の願いを\n叶えてさしあげよう！
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 你们的召唤我游戏基弥回应了！你最后的愿望实现了！
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    translationsCuphead: []
    translationsMugman: []
    enabled: 0
  - m_ID: 2229
    m_Depth: 0
    key: GameDjimmi_Tooltip_Freed
    category: 31
    description: Tool tip prompt for players who use the secret Djimmi code after they have beaten the game
    translations:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: You've freed Game Djimmi! I grant thee infinite wishes\non Simple and Regular Modes!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Vous avez libéré Djinn, le génie des jeux_! Pour vous remercier, je vous accorde un nombre de souhaits infini en mode simple ou normal_!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Hai liberato Gigio Pro-gamer! Esaudisco desideri a volontà nelle modalità facile e normale!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Ihr habt Spiel-Djimmi befreit! Ich gewähre euch unendlich viele Wünsche in den Spielmodi "Leicht" und "Normal"!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: ¡Habéis liberado a Game Genio! ¡Os otorgaré tres deseos infinitos en los modos Fácil y Normal!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: ¡Liberaron a Game Genio! ¡Les otorgaré tres deseos infinitos en los modos Fácil y Normal!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 게임 지니를 풀어 주었구나! 쉬움과 보통 모드에서 무한정으로 소원을 들어 주마!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Ты освободил Джимма игры! Я исполню три твоих желания на низкой или обычной сложности игры!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Dżinn Gry został uwolniony! Teraz masz nieskończoną liczbę życzeń na prostym i zwykłym poziomie trudności.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Você libertou Genésio, o Gamer! Por isso, concedo-lhe desejos infinitos nos modos Fácil e Normal!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: ゲーム魔神ジーミを解き放ったな！\nシンプルモードとレギュラーモード\nにあるかぎり、願い事を無限に\n叶えてさしあげよう！
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 你们放出了游戏基弥！只要开着简单模式和普通模式，不管你们有多少愿望我都能实现！
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    translationsCuphead: []
    translationsMugman: []
    enabled: 0
  - m_ID: 2230
    m_Depth: 0
    key: WinScreen_Tooltip_SimpleIngredient
    category: 23
    description: 'This will be featured below the win screen statistics on matches played on Simple Mode. Translate literally please. RETRANSLATION NOTE: PLEASE REFERENCE LINE 156 IN THIS DOCUMENT AND RETRANSLATE THIS WITH THE WORD "INGREDIENT" IN YOUR LANGUAGE SWAPPED OUT FOR "CONTRACT" WHEREVER POSSIBLE. LINE LENGTH NEEDS REDUCING. '
    translations:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: TRY REGULAR MODE TO GET AN INGREDIENT
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 7
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: OBTENEZ UN INGRÉDIENT EN MODE NORMAL
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 7
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: USA LA MODALITÀ NORMALE PER AVERE UN INGREDIENTE
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 7
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: GEWINNE EINE ZUTAT AUF "NORMAL"
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 7
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: PRUEBA EN EL MODO NORMAL PARA CONSEGUIR UN INGREDIENTE
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 7
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: PRUEBA EL MODO NORMAL PARA CONSEGUIR UN INGREDIENTE
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 17.11
        tmpFontType: 7
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 재료를 획득하려면 보통 모드를 플레이하세요
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 21.4
        tmpFontType: 13
        charSpacing: 0
