  - m_ID: 2255
    m_Depth: 0
    key: NPCChaliceFan/S2_Line1
    category: 27
    description: Line spoken by Chalice Super Fan cactus NPC expressing surprise that Chalice defeated all game bosses herself. "But good" is an old time / American western dialect expression saying you did something very well
    translations:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Wow! That ghostly gal bopped all those baddies but good.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Ça alors_! Ce petit fantôme leur a mis une sacrée raclée, à ces méchants_!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Uao! Quella fantasmina ha davvero sgominato quei cattivoni.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Wow! Dieses Geistermädchen hat all diese Bösewichte besiegt.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: ¦Vaya! Esa chica fantasmagórica le ha zurrado de lo lindo a esos malosos.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: ¦Vaya! Esa chica fantasmagórica le dio una buena paliza a esos malosos.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 와! 그 유령 소녀가 악당을 모두 멋지게 해치웠어.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Ого! Эта призрачная дева отдубасила всех противников, да еще как!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Rany! Ta duszyczka naprawdę nieźle dokopała nicponiom.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Nossa! A moça fantasma distribuiu bofetada naqueles vilões.
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: わーお！\nあのオバケの女の子が悪党どもを\nすっかりぺしゃんこにしちゃったわ！
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: 哇哦！那个幽灵姑娘狠狠教训了所有坏蛋，\n太厉害了！
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
    translationsCuphead: []
    translationsMugman: []
    enabled: 0
  - m_ID: 2256
    m_Depth: 0
    key: NPCChaliceFan/S2_Line2
    category: 27
    description: 'Please refer to separate document provided by Studio MDHR for explanation of this line '
    translations:
    - hasImage: 0
      text: Seein' all them good deeds gives me a whole new perspective on things!
      fonts:
        fontSize: 0
        fontType: 0
        fontAssetSize: 0
        tmpFontType: 0
        charSpacing: 0
      image: {fileID: 0}
      spriteAtlasName:
      spriteAtlasImageName:
